# Advanced flood (v4) configuration overrides.
#
# Flood v4 reads its whole configuration from FLOOD_OPTION_* environment
# variables. The supervisor sets sensible defaults (see
# /usr/local/bin/supervisor, function start_flood) and sources this file
# afterwards, so anything set here wins. Uncomment and adjust as needed.
#
# Examples:
#   FLOOD_OPTION_host=0.0.0.0
#   FLOOD_OPTION_port=3000
#   FLOOD_OPTION_auth=default
#   FLOOD_OPTION_secret=change-me-to-a-long-random-string
#   FLOOD_OPTION_allowedpath=/output,/config/flood
#
# Run `flood --help` inside the container for the full list of options.
